     "notes": {
      "text": "4.Ng5 attacks f7 with knight and bishop, and you cannot castle yet. You must defend f7: 4...h6?? loses to 5.Nxf7, forking queen and rook, and 4...Nxe4? fails to 5.Bxf7+. 4...d5 is the best defence: it blocks the bishop's diagonal at the cost of a pawn.",
